"完了状態を切り替えた直後\",\n      \"note\": \"完了/未完了の差が視認できるか、行の情報密度が崩れないかを確認する。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","jsonRepair":{"repaired":false,"repairKind":"none"},"referenceDocuments":[{"id":"root","kind":"root","source":"builtin","relativePath":"SKILL.md","digest":"sha256:2ff3bd38b65592c36bb1165a7725e5ea47413d8f5deba9581ca005935a40204c"},{"id":"router","kind":"router","source":"builtin","relativePath":"references/router.md","digest":"sha256:fdae67217ca454b917c2d2cf6cffedd4b3a786c68b7126540a3c0428a3f2d9a5"},{"id":"plan","kind":"phase","source":"builtin","relativePath":"references/phases/plan.md","digest":"sha256:05eb475bf24f72c4d25a593ef51ab7cd66244320e8a403e7cc13dccfe63f78de"},{"id":"planning","kind":"mode","source":"builtin","relativePath":"references/modes/planning.md","digest":"sha256:c973a103a50811e6f94c924abbe319c703a8cc84cf5eda69462523acdd2d7352"},{"id":"review","kind":"mode","source":"builtin","relativePath":"references/modes/review.md","digest":"sha256:88b49f5fb40c4f7bf3294d8dc32b604b5b2ef730f0aba7c9c405ab6fee0bd83c"},{"id":"blueprint","kind":"work_kind","source":"builtin","relativePath":"references/work_kinds/blueprint.md","digest":"sha256:77791dc9fdd07a5c5b07f607ec5d96bcf50963a54bbd183022bf5b7b54003fca"},{"id":"ui_ux","kind":"work_kind","source":"builtin","relativePath":"references/work_kinds/ui_ux.md","digest":"sha256:82fd62debbd08d209353b00944994d3e41ac0a349efbf317a26c0d7060e8dbb0"},{"id":"user_facing_change","kind":"overlay","source":"builtin","relativePath":"references/overlays/user_facing_change.md","digest":"sha256:d101919d9d74420459aed420c7b6881c75a83eb225bd37ff50c8c463beacfbcf"}],"promptDiagnostics":{"schemaIncluded":true,"schemaDigest":"26c2f719f00d09b0572b1381ebc1d04ed35b9f1fad395fd979fd68a048b5a884","schemaBytes":32449,"catalogComponentCount":40,"referenceDocumentCount":8,"referenceDocuments":[{"id":"root","kind":"root","source":"builtin","relativePath":"SKILL.md","digest":"sha256:2ff3bd38b65592c36bb1165a7725e5ea47413d8f5deba9581ca005935a40204c"},{"id":"router","kin